@startuml
title Figure 8 — UML Activity diagram — analysis history review
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam activity {
  BackgroundColor #F7F7F7
  BorderColor #333333
}

|Customer Care Operator|
start
:Open analysis history for selected customer;

|React operator UI|
:Submit protected history request;

|Security / HTTP adapter|
if (Authenticated?) then (no)
  :Reject / redirect;
  |React operator UI|
  :Display authentication required;
  |Customer Care Operator|
  stop
else (yes)
  :Attach OperatorId;
endif

|Analysis application|
:Request history through\nAnalysisHistoryPort;

|History adapter|
:Read persisted analyses;
:Map persistence rows to\nAnalysisHistoryEntry values;

|Analysis application|
:Return AnalysisHistoryEntry list;

|React operator UI|
:Render analysis identity,\ngeneration time, operator, result,\nand evidence provenance;

|Customer Care Operator|
:Inspect prior analysis;
stop
@enduml
